<%# On every broadcast compose form: what broadcasts may carry (see BroadcastScreener). %>
<div class="cs-alert">
  <%= cs_status_icon(:info) %>
  <p>
    <strong>Logistics only: no promotional material.</strong>
    Don't include sponsor offers, discount or promo codes, free domains or software, or ads for other programs.
    Share those at the event or from your event's own email instead.
    Attend checks every message before it goes out, and a Hack Club HQ staffer reviews anything that looks promotional.
  </p>
</div>
